and fourteen billion dollars saved by slightly fewer explosions.

4
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:24,280
The worst-case scenario is still the largest increase in medical research in history.

5
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:32,700
Here's what one percent less murder money buys you. The one percent Treaty Fund gets twenty-seven point two billion dollars

6
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:40,520
